WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:03.181
Check visible shared usage before substantial dispatch and

00:00:03.216 --> 00:00:04.017
after batches.

00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:08.173
Dave's example reserves 25 percent and stops discretionary

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.831
cloud dispatch at 75 percent used; your own policy can

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:12.295
differ.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.360
At the threshold, continue safe independent work through

00:00:15.395 --> 00:00:18.448
available deterministic or local means and preserve

00:00:18.495 --> 00:00:22.489
capacity for essential completion, recovery, and handoff.

00:00:23.092 --> 00:00:26.866
If usage is unknown, avoid discretionary cloud dispatch

00:00:26.924 --> 00:00:30.151
and retain only the minimum authorized cloud work needed

00:00:30.476 --> 00:00:32.392
for safe completion and handoff.

00:00:32.903 --> 00:00:35.968
The exact behavior must respect the actual platform and

00:00:36.003 --> 00:00:36.989
the owner's permissions.
